{"id":"n72435-1-3","stage":2,"title":"한둘 · 一二","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72435-1-3-1","ko":"나 이번 시험에서 떨어졌어.","zh":"我这次考试没及格啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"시험에서","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험에서","audio":"/audio/03bc4310d38533975076.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어졌어.","meaning":"落榜","explanation":"떨어지다：落榜；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"9","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어졌어","audio":"/audio/04c43ebe2660e53e7f9b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"5360fef