explanation":"한둘：一二；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"한둘","audio":"/audio/b4cbd9bdfb5b2a272939.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72435","senseId":"1","lemma":"한둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한둘인가","audio":"/audio/34e0227ec095a4f89a04.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"落榜","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"未能通过考试、选拔等。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"怎么，哪里，哪能","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60320","definition":"用于反问的语气，意在强调。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"b4cbd9bdfb5b2a27","term":"한둘","zh":"一二","audio":"/audio/b4cbd9bdfb5b2a272939.mp3","entryId":"72435","definition":"大约为一或二的数目。","pronunciation":["한둘"]}],"audio":"/audio/3fb68b95ae4f489494d8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.858,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72435","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":66,"sequenceScore":1.6847,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["题目那么难，没及格的可不止一两个人啊。","我这次考试没及格啊。","您之前有来过我们医院吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我这次考试没及格啊。","您之前有来过我们医院吗？","题目那么难，没及格的可不止一两个人啊。"],"answer":2}]}
